# p2-jettison.drv - Phase 2 tour: one unit of cargo jettisoned, seen close.
#
# Verifies: B10 the jettisoned canister (model 184, docs/hd/hulls.md).
# Run:  tools/p2shots --routes jettison --base BASE --branch BRANCH
# Expect: 01 the external view, paused about 0.15 s after the jettison,
#         turned to look up at the ship's underside and zoomed in one step:
#         the canister side-on near the middle, in front of the hull, some
#         20 to 25 m from the eye (about 230 px tall at 1600x1200); 02 the
#         same view half a second of game time later. The game picks the
#         canister's drift, so it sits a little elsewhere each run.
# Start 3 (docked), new game; buys one unit from the market's first page.
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 3
wait 11000
mouse 57 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 271 146
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 129 33
wait 300
click 200
wait 1500
mouse 57 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 171 57
wait 300
click 200
wait 3000
wait 30000
sdlkey f1
wait 1500
mouse 39 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2000
sdlkey f3
wait 1500
sdlkey f3
wait 1500
mouse 11 38
wait 300
click 200
# pause at once, so the canister is still by the ship
wait 150
sdlkey esc
wait 400
# paused: the flight view, then the view button: the ship from outside
sdlkey f1
wait 600
mouse 8 193
wait 200
click 200
wait 600
mouse 2 120
wait 300
# still paused: turn the view to look up at the underside, zoom in a step
# (three short turns: a long hold turns faster as it goes)
keydown down
wait 1000
keyup down
wait 300
keydown down
wait 1000
keyup down
wait 300
keydown down
wait 1000
keyup down
wait 300
keydown kp_minus
wait 150
keyup kp_minus
wait 500
shot 01-canister
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 500
sdlkey esc
wait 500
shot 02-canister-half-s
sdlkey f1 shift
wait 300
quit
